# Desk ops invariants

Complement [enterprise-core.mdc](enterprise-core.mdc) and [pelbu-hotel-ops](../skills/pelbu-hotel-ops/SKILL.md). Do not restate money atomics here.

- **StayHub is the only stay editor.** Rack, Today, book modal, check-in, POS, and laundry open that card. Lists are not a second editor.
- **Offline must not park** a folio charge, payment, night audit, or kitchen fire. Drafts for book/POS tickets only.
- **Agent checkout** needs guide evidence before leave; open-room caps may block.
- **Manager PIN** for agent AR / void / comp / agreed-rate thresholds; open-folio edits use the folio-edit cookie after PIN.
- **Zero balance** must not settle the folio until the master bill (fiscal invoice) exists when the desk flow requires it.
- Confirmation `PS-…` is not the fiscal `INV-` print — issue INV only when the desk asks.
